### IDE ###
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/extensions.json

### OS ###
.DS_Store

### Build output at the repo root ###
# server/.gitignore only governs server/, so the monorepo root needs its own
# copies of these — otherwise a root-level build or a stray run drops artifacts
# that nothing is ignoring.
target/
HELP.md

### Local databases — never commit ###
# A dev run with no ATLAS_DB_PATH set writes atlas.db into the working directory.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

### Local deployment and setup ###
# This repo is the app. Anything describing how one particular person deploys it
# — compose overrides, env files, migration tooling for a specific database —
# lives outside, not here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
